    <briefdescription>
<para>Listens to PopupMenuManager.OnLodChange and forces all LODGroup components in the active patent to a specific LOD level. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>LOD 0 = full quality; LOD 1 = simplified mesh generated by GenerateLOD. </para>
